  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II. </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"center left center left\" columnlines=\"solid\" frame=\"solid\" rowlines=\"solid\"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mtext> List-I </mtext></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mtext> List-II </mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mtext> A. </mtext></mtd><mtd><mtext> Coefficient of viscosity </mtext></mtd><mtd><mtext> I. </mtext></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mtext> B. </mtext></mtd><mtd><mtext> Surface Tension </mtext></mtd><mtd><mtext> II. </mtext></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mtext> C. </mtext></mtd><mtd><mtext> Angular momentum </mtext></mtd><mtd><mtext> III. </mtext></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mtext> D. </mtext></mtd><mtd><mtext> Rotational kinetic energy </mtext></mtd><mtd><mtext> IV. </mtext></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
